    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "e22a8376-0f06-4ae0-b85f-7b8bd0ab6780",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Disco Elysium",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110947218274",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "After his brother's death in 2012, Amos Dexter has been ruthlessly running Dexter Industries, pushing a plan to globalize the arms industry and put more coin in his pocket.\r\rHowever, despite finalizing talks with the GAMA director Akira Nakamura to arm security at the hospital, Dexter has stayed three days past his welcome. His presence now forming a rather unpleasant image of a late-stage alcoholic in lieu of his generally militant approach to business.\r\rNakamura, who was hesistant but capable of handling Dexter at the hospital, has changed his mind after Dexter drunkenly assaulted one of the hospital's expensive commissioned taxidermies with no attempt at transferring reparatory funds.\r\rUsually this would be a non-issue due to the increased amount of security and their ability to order Dexter off the property. However, Nakamura's fund was instantly used to pay off top security personnel to bar any staff attempting to dispose of him as well as one of the chefs to keep himself inside without need to worry for hunger and thirst.\r\rWe have been contracted by Nakamura to permanently remove Dexter from the premises, and he's thrown in a bonus if you manage to eliminate the other three conspirators.\r\rIt's time to walk the desert, agent. Good luck.\r\rThis contract was made by a member of the Hitman Community known as Script.",
        "GameVersion": "8.9.0.44",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO"
        ],
